// Embedded SDL2 GameControllerDB mappings for popular Android, Bluetooth, USB,
// and handheld controllers so gamepads work out of the box without requiring an
// external gamecontrollerdb.txt file on Android or desktop.
//
// All mappings follow SDL's positional Xbox-style convention (used together with
// SDL_HINT_GAMECONTROLLER_USE_BUTTON_LABELS="0"):
//   a = South (PS Cross), b = East (PS Circle),
//   x = West (PS Square), y = North (PS Triangle).
//
// Users can still place a custom gamecontrollerdb.txt in the working/data
// directory to override or add mappings; SDL gives later mappings precedence.
package qol

@(private)
EMBEDDED_GAMECONTROLLERDB :: #string ---
# Android generic & popular Bluetooth / USB-C / handheld controllers
# Format: GUID,Name,mapping...,platform:Android,
